# Security

Reference: `docs/development/14-SECURITY_GUIDE.md`, `docs/architecture/MULTI_TENANT.md`

Security is designed in, not added later.

## Every request

Assume hostile input. Every Convex mutation/action/query that touches business data must:

1. Authenticate
2. Authorize (role / permission / organization / branch)
3. Validate input
4. Enforce business rules

Never trust the client. Never trust `args.organizationId`.

## Least privilege

Cashiers must not reach admin capabilities through UI or API gaps.

## Secrets

No secrets in source, commits, or client bundles.

## Data exposure

Return only fields the caller is allowed to see. Do not leak cost prices or other organizations’ data.
